with the Olsen twins.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:15.083
I wish I could be like them
one day, they're so cool.

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.290
They're the coolest ever.

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:20.890
And I love how they dress,
they're very fashionable.

